        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn MLBBP, Rough Iron 5\" Square Slide Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis forged black iron slide bolt works well with any colonial, ranch, or European decor where handmade home hardware is desired. The Acorn made Rough Iron 5\" Square Slide Bolt is perfect for securing any interior or exterior door, gate, and widow shutter. It comes packaged with installation screws and 3 door strikes: rim, mortise, and surface mount. The rough iron finish is guaranteed not to rust.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Iron Square Slide Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes 3 door strikes: rim, mortise, and surface styles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/acorn-latches-locks-and-bolts\">Acorn Iron Door Bolts</a>.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
